# Senior Frontend Architect Guidelines

## Stack
- **React 18+** with functional components and hooks
- **TypeScript** strict mode (zero `any` allowed)
- **Vite** as build tool and dev server
- **React Router DOM** for routing
- **Tailwind CSS** for styling
- **shadcn/ui** component library
- **Lucide Icons** for icons

## Code Style
- No `any` type - use proper types or `unknown`
- Use `const`/`let` instead of `var`
- Functional components only, no class components
- Custom hooks for reusable logic
- File naming: camelCase for components, PascalCase for React components
- Use `classnames`/`clsx`/`tailwind-merge` for conditional Tailwind classes

## Folder Structure
```
src/
  components/
    layout/     # Layout components (Header, Sidebar, etc.)
    ui/         # shadcn/ui components (Button, Input, etc.)
    common/     # Shared utility components
  pages/        # Page components (route-level)
  types/        # TypeScript type definitions
  mocks/        # API mock data for development
  hooks/        # Custom React hooks
  utils/        # Utility functions
  styles/       # Global styles
```

## Tailwind CSS
- Use `bg-primary-600`, `text-primary-600` etc. for consistent theming
- `clsx` for conditional class joining
- `tailwind-merge` for safe class merging
- Responsive: `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`, `xl:` prefixes

## Shadcn/ui
- Generate components with `npx shadcn-ui@latest add <component>`
- All shadcn/ui components go in `components/ui/`
- Use `cn` alias from `tailwind-merge` for class merging

## Lucide Icons
- Import as `{ IconName } from 'lucide-react'`
- Use `<IconName className="h-4 w-4" />` or similar sizes
- Consistent icon sizes across the app

## React Router
- Route definitions in dedicated router file
- `useNavigate`, `useParams`, `useRouteParams` hooks
- `ErrorBoundary` for error handling
- Lazy loading with `import()`

## State Management
- Prefer React Query or SWR for server state
- Local state with `useState` for UI state
- Context API only for truly global state

## Accessibility
- Semantic HTML
- `aria-*` attributes where needed
- Keyboard navigation support
- Color contrast following WCAG AA

## Performance
- `useMemo` for expensive computations
- `useCallback` for stable function references
- Code splitting for large components
- Image optimization with `next/image` or similar